segment_info.description:
Audience targeting. To target all users, use the built-in moe_all_users segment:
  {"filters": {"included_filters": {"filter_operator": "and", "filters": [{"filter_type": "custom_segments", "id": "moe_all_users", "name": "All Users"}]}}}
For attribute-based targeting, use filter_type: "user_attributes" with data_type required.

OfferSegmentInfo.description:
Segment targeting configuration that controls which users are eligible to
receive this offering.

`included_filters`: criteria a user MUST match to be eligible.
`excluded_filters`: criteria that DISQUALIFY a user even if they match the
included filters.

To target **all users**, use the built-in `moe_all_users` segment:
```json
{
  "filters": {
    "included_filters": {
      "filter_operator": "and",
      "filters": [
        {
          "filter_type": "custom_segments",
          "id": "moe_all_users",
          "name": "All Users"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
